# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee11.rpy:4
translate italian mrsmcgee11_ee474ea1:

    # "In English class, Mrs. McGee has us working on our essays in class again."
    "Durante la lezione di inglese, la signora McGee ci fa lavorare di nuovo sui nostri saggi in classe."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee11.rpy:5
translate italian mrsmcgee11_aaf24ec9:

    # "She walks around the room answering questions from any students and looking over their essays."
    "Si aggira per l’aula rispondendo alle domande degli studenti e dando un’occhiata ai loro saggi."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee11.rpy:8
translate italian mrsmcgee11_5f37473f:

    # "When she gets to me, she leans in, passes me a note, and whispers."
    "Quando arriva da me, si avvicina, mi passa un biglietto e mi sussurra."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee11.rpy:9
translate italian mrsmcgee11_5ea92b9a:

    # et "I enjoyed having you over the other night."
    et "Mi è piaciuto averti a cena l’altra sera."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee11.rpy:10
translate italian mrsmcgee11_a3ce88ea:

    # et "Give me a call some time if you want to visit again."
    et "Chiamami qualche volta se vuoi venire di nuovo a trovarmi."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee11.rpy:12
translate italian mrsmcgee11_ca2a0e41:

    # "I take a look at the note and see that she's written her phone number down on it. I'll have to add her to my cell phone later."
    "Do un'occhiata al biglietto e vedo che ci ha scritto il suo numero di telefono. Dovrò aggiungerla al mio cellulare più tardi."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee11.rpy:13
translate italian mrsmcgee11_f9bd1236:

    # "I'd definitely like to see more of her."
    "Mi piacerebbe sicuramente rivederla."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee11.rpy:15
translate italian mrsmcgee11_2c651ab1:

    # "After her class, I continue on with the rest of my school day and eventually leave to go to work."
    "Dopo la sua lezione, proseguo con il resto della mia giornata scolastica e alla fine me ne vado per andare al lavoro."

